Package: ParmOff
Type: Package
Title: Complex Argument Matching
Version: 1.0.3
Date: 2026-05-27
Authors@R: person(given = "Aaron",
                      family = "Robotham",
                      role = c("aut", "cre"),
                      email = "aaron.robotham@uwa.edu.au")
Description: Provides a flexible framework for matching and validating function
    arguments against user-defined expectations, including named and positional
    handling, range limits, and logarithmic transforms. It is designed to
    simplify robust argument processing in reusable code while keeping function
    interfaces clear, predictable, and easy to extend.
